    "extract": "Pooja Entertainment is an Indian production and distribution company established by Vashu Bhagnani in 1986. It is based in Mumbai, Maharashtra, India. The company is known for producing the comedies: Coolie No. 1 (1995), Hero No. 1 (1997), and Biwi No.1 (1999). It has produced over 40 films as of 2024.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Pooja Entertainment</b> is an Indian production and distribution company established by Vashu Bhagnani in 1986. It is based in Mumbai, Maharashtra, India. The company is known for producing the comedies: <i>Coolie No. 1</i> (1995), <i>Hero No. 1</i> (1997), and <i>Biwi No.1</i> (1999). It has produced over 40 films as of 2024.</p>"
